  "_comment": "Structural contract shared by aiui's two MCP bridges: the Rust one in companion/src-tauri/src/mcp.rs (tools_list) and the Python one in python/src/aiui_mcp/server.py. Both are asserted against this file (companion/src-tauri/src/mcp.rs::tests and python/tests/test_tool_schema_parity.py), so a tool, argument or default added on one bridge only turns red instead of drifting (#211).",
