    "type: one JSON-Schema type name. Optional[T] (an anyOf with null, as FastMCP emits it) collapses to T; 'integer' is recorded as 'number'.",
    "default: recorded only when it is a non-null scalar. FastMCP's default: null for an omitted optional argument is treated as 'no default'.",
    "A default written as an object {\"rust\": …, \"python\": …} is a KNOWN divergence between the bridges; each side's test asserts its own value, so changing it on one bridge only still fails."
